  {
   "section": "7",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "LogiMAT 2026",
     "href": "../../../en/Landingpage/Logimat/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "At LogiMAT 2026 in Stuttgart, visitors explored our automation and digital solutions alongside innovative vehicles and energy concept - all under our motto: \"Composed Around You.\""
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Find out more",
     "href": "../../../en/Landingpage/Logimat/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Automation Summit 2025",
     "href": "../../../en/Landingpage/Automation-Summit-2025/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "In November, we brought together experts, customers, and partners from around Europe at our Linde Experience Hub in Aschaffenburg. The event highlighted our commitment to accessible, cost‑effective automation tailored to your needs."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Find out more",
     "href": "../../../en/Landingpage/Automation-Summit-2025/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "StaplerCup Finals",
     "href": "https://www.staplercup.com/en/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Thrilling action, top‑level competition, and the world’s best forklift community – that’s the StaplerCup. Watch the best drivers compete live at the StaplerCup Finals at the LINDE MH ARENA in Aschaffenburg."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Find out more",
     "href": "https://www.staplercup.com/en/"
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 3,
   "editableTexts": 6,
