  {
   "section": "8",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Linde Material Handling at A+A 2025",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/A-A-Fair-for-Safety.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Driven by the motto “Vision ZERO. Safety in your world,” we attended the A+A in Düsseldorf. At the international trade fair and congress for personal protection and occupational health and safety, Linde MH presented a range of solutions, including the Reverse Assist Radar assistance system."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Find out more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/A-A-Fair-for-Safety.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "World of Material Handling 2022",
     "href": "https://www.worldofmaterialhandling.com/en/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "From June 20–30, we had the pleasure of welcoming large numbers of visitors from around the world to the Mannheim May Market. In the spirit of the tagline “YOUR WAY IS OUR WAY”, our guests had the opportunity to test all of the trucks, technologies, and tools on offer from Linde MH and its partners."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Find out more",
     "href": "https://www.worldofmaterialhandling.com/en/"
    }
   ],
